{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：08:09 2026-11-24 HKT<br/>發佈時間：08:09 2026-11-24 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：08:09 2026-11-24 HKT</p><img alt=\"黎志偉攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be95af90acdca2fc53f886b3f5b47a49/2026-11/2026-11-23_23_59_29.png\"/><p>一道冷鋒已橫過廣東沿岸，與其相關的東北季候風及雲雨帶正影響該區。本港方面，今早各區氣溫普遍較昨日低兩三度。</p><p>本港地區今日多雲，有幾陣雨。日間氣溫徘徊在21度左右，晚上市區氣溫下降至最低約19度，新界再低一兩度。吹和緩至清勁偏北風，離岸及高地間中吹強風。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/929638cd7ef520958baa7a7e8cecbe62/2026-11/2026-11-24_00_00_41.png\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d795d5665e926214af741c3f962013ec/2026-11/2026-11-24_00_00_51.png\"/><p>展望未來一兩日早晚清涼，市區最低氣溫在16度左右，新界再低兩三度。本週後期天色逐漸好轉，氣溫回升，內陸地區日夜溫差頗大。<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T00:22:59.633773+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":270,"images":3,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T00:09:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T03:37:32.164422+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T00:16:32.222094+00:00","content_hash":"fac32c87672f545d7fe792dd1d86b5bd4dd0e1fad91a38bf4a91b833e4668843","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}